 "lines": {"tire_swing_scour_hole": ["Whose muck is this. Don't answer, it's obviously a pigeon's.", "Scrubbed it. The pigeon will just do it again out of spite."], "tire_swing_ride_the_unwind": ["Round and round. Gave me a new perspective: nothing has changed.", "Nope. Nothing's stopped spinning. Including me."], "tire_swing_through_the_hole": ["Through the hole. Out the other side. Nothing changed. Still me.", "Threaded myself. Eight out of ten, dismount was ropey."], "tire_swing_poke_and_run": ["Poked it. Ran. It's still coming. They always come back.", "I'm not scared. I'm tactically elsewhere."], "tire_swing_sniff_the_rubber": ["Rubber. Old rubber. A tyre that's seen things. Mostly dogs.", "Smells like a road. Never been on a road. Hate it."], "tire_swing_sulk_at_the_post": ["Nobody asked the swing. The swing didn't offer. Fine.", "I'm not sulking. I'm the post now."], "tire_swing_throne_pose": ["Sat in a tyre. Called it a throne. Nobody argued. Nobody was here.", "All hail me. The swing's the ruler of nothing."], "tire_swing_argue_with_the_tyre": ["It's a circle. It's a rubber circle. Why's everyone so impressed.", "I've been outclassed by something that hangs from a rope."], "tire_swing_hold_court_by_the_post": ["And then I said, nobody. Because I'm speaking to a post.", "Lovely crowd. Doesn't heckle. Doesn't leave."], "tire_swing_chip_off_the_frost": ["Frost. The tyre's gone all sparkly. It had a plan and I ruined it.", "Chipped it off. It'll be back. So will I."], "tire_swing_stamp_the_puddle": ["Puddle. Mine. Finders keepers, droppers weepers.", "Boots are for people with fewer feathers."], "tire_swing_wedged_in_hole": ["Wedged by the arse. Dignity: gone.", "I meant to do that. All of it. Especially the stuck part."], "tire_swing_hit_by_the_return": ["OW. Shit. Okay. Zero stars, would touch again.", "That's the last time I turn my back on a tyre."], "tire_swing_bill_frozen_to_the_rim": ["Bill stuck to it. Nobody saw that. Nobody's allowed to have seen that.", "Frost has a sense of humour, and it's trash."]},
